180	     *  Refused when its due-by is inside a closed period, or when it would be a correction that does not name a
181	     *  SETTLED claim of its person, when its external reference is already used by another claim on the sheet, or
182	     *  while another user has its editor open, or when it has lines and another amount is given. Saving releases its lock and records this user as its last editor. */
183	    @Transactional
