645	     *  number, gets none) with its old number never used again, loses any figure a statement bound it to (it is live again until its new person's next statement), and is
646	     *  listed as its new person's newest claim. Refused for a role the permission matrix does not allow (by default a clerk), for a SETTLED or VOID claim, for a move to the
647	     *  person it is already of, for one due by inside a closed period or after the new person retired, and for a
648	     *  correction the new person has no SETTLED claim of that number for. */
